---

<section class="s-hero" aria-label="introduction">
  <div class="s-hero__meta vf-mono">
    <span>riyadh</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <span>10th grade</span>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <span class="js-clock">--:--</span>
  </div>

  <h1 class="s-hero__title vf-display">
    <span class="s-hero__line js-hero-line">abdullah</span>
    <span class="s-hero__line js-hero-line">sultan</span>
  </h1>

  <p class="s-hero__role vf-mono">student builder · math · cs · products</p>

  <p class="s-hero__lede vf-serif">
    i ship tutoring that moves grades, an f1 blog with a real voice, and a python quant suite.
    looking for coffee chats with founders and recruiters.
  </p>

  <div class="s-hero__actions vf-mono">
    <a href="#work" class="s-hero__btn s-hero__btn--solid">see work</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="s-hero__btn">talk</a>
    <a href="/resume.docx" class="s-hero__btn">resume</a>
  </div>

  <ul class="s-hero__ticks vf-mono" aria-label="quick facts">
    <li><strong>+2.03</strong> ib grade lift</li>
    <li><strong>3</strong> quant apps live</li>
    <li><strong>x-c</strong> incubator founder</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .s-hero {
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 5rem var(--vf-pad) 4rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .s-hero__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--vf-mark);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .s-hero__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 13vw, 8.5rem);
    max-width: 12ch;
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .s-hero__line {
    display: block;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .s-hero__char {
    display: inline-block;
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .s-hero__role {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .s-hero__lede {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.2vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .s-hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }
  .s-hero__btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.15rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--vf-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .s-hero__btn:hover {
    background: var(--vf-ink);
    color: var(--vf-field);
  }
  .s-hero__btn--solid {
    background: var(--vf-ink);
    color: var(--vf-field);
  }
  .s-hero__btn--solid:hover {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--vf-ink);
  }
  .s-hero__ticks {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem 1.75rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--vf-line);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }
  .s-hero__ticks strong {
    color: var(--vf-mark);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-right: 0.35rem;
  }
</style>
